   * @x-autobe-authorization-type null
   * @x-autobe-authorization-actor customer
   * @x-autobe-specification Create a new cart item in the specified customer's cart. Validate that the cart exists and belongs to the authenticated customer. Verify the product variant exists, is not deleted, and has available stock (stock quantity > 0). Check if the variant already exists in the cart - if yes, increment quantity instead of creating duplicate. If no, create new cart item. Enforce quantity must be positive integer. Return the created/updated cart item with current stock availability status.
   * @nestia Generated by Nestia - https://github.com/samchon/nestia
   */
  @TypedRoute.Post()
  public async create(
