   * **Edge Cases:**
   * - Item already deleted: Return 404
   * - Wrong wishlistId provided: Return 404
   * - Customer owns wishlist but item belongs to different wishlist: Return 404
   * - Product referenced by item was deleted: Item should already be auto-removed via cascade, return 404
   * @nestia Generated by Nestia - https://github.com/samchon/nestia
   */
  @TypedRoute.Delete(":itemId")
  public async erase(
